VALUES ('frederick.stone@harmonygames.co/<01070196aa042300-6aa1f6b0-e3bd-4749-aee8-249ca19c3e2f-000000@eu-central-1.amazonses.com>', 'frederick.stone@harmonygames.co/1830999337380347892', 'frederick.stone@harmonygames.co', '["INBOX", "Label_b19fb8d1b3", "CATEGORY_PERSONAL"]', 'Hi Leonard, thanks for the numbers. We reviewed them and agree to a credit of $1,271.40 on the April invoice, so the April total comes to $1', 1746609120000, '2025-05-07T09:12:00Z', 2951, 'Re: [SOURCE_ORG_0001] - [USERNAME_14101] Invoice - 04/2025', 'SVC_2836_EMAIL', NULL, '["leonard hayes <leonard.hayes@harmonygames.co>"]', '["SVC_2392_EMAIL", "SVC_1183_EMAIL", "frederick.stone@harmonygames.co"]', '[]', '[]', E'Hi Leonard, thanks for the numbers. We reviewed them and agree to a credit of $1,271.40 on the April invoice, so the April total comes to $10,733.60. Part of the gap is installs Singular doesn''t count, so we can''t credit all of it. We''ll net it from the payment you initiated.\r\n\r\nBest regards\r\n\r\n[USERNAME_14102]\r\n\r\nOn Mon, May 5, 2025 at 6:30 PM Leonard Hayes <leonard.hayes@harmonygames.co> wrote:\r\n> Hi, we''re contesting part of the April invoice. It bills 2,401 installs, but\r\n> Singular only shows 1,923 from you for April. Can you take a look?\r\n', NULL, '[{"name": "X-GM-THRID", "value": "1830999337380347892"}, {"name": "X-Gmail-Labels", "value": "INBOX,Label_b19fb8d1b3,CATEGORY_PERSONAL"}, {"name": "Delivered-To", "value": "frederick.stone@harmonygames.co"}, {"name": "Date", "value": "Wed, 07 May 2025 02:12:00 -0700"}, {"name": "To", "value": "leonard hayes <leonard.hayes@harmonygames.co>"}, {"name": "Subject", "value": "Re: [SOURCE_ORG_0001] - [USERNAME_14101] Invoice - 04/2025"}, {"name": "From", "value": "SVC_2836_EMAIL"}, {"name": "Cc", "value": "SVC_2392_EMAIL, SVC_1183_EMAIL, frederick.stone@harmonygames.co"}, {"name": "In-Reply-To", "value": "<CAPBs_a7tLJ57UFdsCW9u4oM1rRsxY66g4dAx0j84aZj-yzbcn4@mail.gmail.com>"}, {"name": "References", "value": "<0107019690