VALUES ('6807be2c1ea290e4382b33be', 'UA spend buckets - DD incent test', '66da196af476ab78deaa0cef', '66da196af476ab78deaa0cf7', 'Domino Delights incent test, Apr to Jun. Adjoe and AppLovin go in the fundraising bucket because we only run them to show early ROAS to investors. Meta and Google stay in real UA.', 49152.0, false, NULL, false, '["4b4a68fc0fec0b254e4f9d8e"]', '[]', 41, NULL, NULL, 'https://PERSON_6092_TRELLO_USERNAME.com/c/30D2F0b5/41-ua-spend-buckets-dd-incent-test', '2025-04-22T16:05:00Z', NULL, '{"attachments": 0, "attachmentsByType": {"trello": {"board": 0, "card": 0}}, "checkItems": 0, "checkItemsChecked": 0, "checkItemsEarliestDue": null, "comments": 0, "description": true, "due": null, "dueComplete": false, "externalSource": null, "fogbugz": "", "lastUpdatedByAi": false, "location": false, "maliciousAttachments": 0, "start": null, "votes": 0}', NULL, NULL);
